mily: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Diffuse</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Bone marrow pattern</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Predominantly intrasinusoidal</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Interstitial</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Nodular</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mixed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Interstitial</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Intrasinusoidal</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Nodular</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mixed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Intrasinusoidal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Interstitial</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.15pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Morphology/cytology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monomorphic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Small cells</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Marginal-zone cells</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Isolated large cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monomorphic with visible nucleoli</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monomorphic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Peripheral blood cytology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.15pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"160\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monomorphic: villous lymphocytes (round and regular nucleus; clumped chromatin; small or not visible nucleolus; basophilic cytoplasm with polar, well-visible projections)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Polymorphous: small lymphocytes (round nucleus, condensed chromatin in small irregular clumps) admixed with lymphoplasmacytic cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monomorphic: intermediate between prolymphocytes and hairy cells, and distinguished from villous lymphocytes by prominent nucleolus</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Monomorphic: hairy cells (oval and indented nucleus, dispersed chromatin, abundant and pale cytoplasm with circumference projections)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Immunophenotype by immunohistochemistry</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 30.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.15pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"160\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cyclin</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">D1</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.6pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"186\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 139.65pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0